          "category": "description",
          "text": "Affected devices do not properly handle multiple incoming Profinet packets received in rapid succession.\r\nAn unauthenticated remote attacker can exploit this flaw by sending multiple packets in a very short time frame, which leads to a crash of the dcpd process.",
          "title": "CVE Description"
        }
      ],
